endobj
277 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 208 0 R
/E (The primary objective of the EntoFARM project is to enhance environmental awareness and understanding of circular economy practices among diverse groups of secondary school students by introducing innovative insect farming as a practical application of sustainability. More particularly, EntoFARM aims to promote interest in circular economy and sustainability strategies by engaging students in the design, development, and management of small-scale insect farms. Additionally, it aims to empower teachers by providing innovative resources, specifically a comprehensive educational toolkit on circular economy and insect farming, designed to strengthen their capacity to deliver engaging, up-to-date lessons on sustainability and effectively integrate these topics into their curricula. )
/Pg 13 0 R
/K [1]
>>
endobj
